{
  "id": "b19_yue03",
  "title": "見光就乞嚏",
  "title_source": "scripted",
  "genre": "Cantonese cumbia",
  "language": "yue",
  "language_name": "Cantonese",
  "mood": "sunny, comic, swaying dance bounce",
  "persona": "",
  "subject": "a woman in a windowless Sham Shui Po subdivided flat who sneezes three times every morning the moment she steps out of the dark stairwell into sunlight, while the herbal-tea shop owner downstairs counts them, and three rainy days without a sneeze leave her feeling she has not woken up",
  "caption": "Cantonese cumbia, Colombian-Mexican sonidera style. Button accordion playing bright melody runs, scraped güiro on every offbeat, clean electric bass on the cumbia two-step, congas and timbales fills. Warm live-band room sound, dry and close. Female mid-register vocal, bright and cheeky, clearly sung melody. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 96 BPM, A minor. Sunny street-corner comedy with a swaying dance bounce. No reggaeton dembow, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no rap, no EDM synths.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n劏房冇窗黑麻麻\n落樓梯摸住扶手\n推開鐵閘一陣光\n我即刻乞嚏三聲\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n樓下涼茶舖老闆\n企喺門口幫我數\n\n[Chorus]\n乞嚏 乞嚏 乞嚏\n一見太陽就係咁\n唔係感冒唔使驚\n係我同日頭打招呼\n\n[Verse]\n醫生話我天生咁\n見光個鼻就會癢\n上司聽到我咁大聲\n叫我戴多個口罩\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n老闆娘遞張紙巾\n話今日數到四聲\n\n[Chorus]\n乞嚏 乞嚏 乞嚏\n一見太陽就係咁\n今日仲多咗一聲\n老闆娘笑到彎腰\n\n[Verse]\n一連三日都落雨\n推開鐵閘冇反應\n個鼻靜到好陌生\n成朝好似未瞓醒\n\n[Bridge]\n第四朝雲散咗\n我企喺門口等\n等住嗰陣光\n\n[Chorus]\n乞嚏 乞嚏 乞嚏\n太陽返嚟就係咁\n成條街同我講早晨\n我噴完先答得出\n\n[Outro]\n乞嚏 乞嚏\n早晨",
